OL,3,AOne in eight young people still out of
OL,4,Awork or education ahead of major review
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust under one million young people in
OL,7,Fthe UK are not in education, employment
OL,8,For training - or "Neet" - according to
OL,9,Fdata published ahead of a major report
OL,10,Fabout a "lost generation".
OL,12,FThe latest data from the Office for
OL,13,FNational Statistics (ONS) suggests
OL,14,F981,000 people aged 16 to 24 were Neet
OL,15,Fbetween April and June. That is about
OL,16,Fone in eight people in that age group.
OL,18,FThe final instalment of a major report
OL,19,Fby former minister Alan Milburn is
OL,20,Fexpected to set out recommendations for
OL,21,Ftackling the problem in the coming
OL,22,Fweeks.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
