OL,3,AOne in eight young people still out of
OL,4,Awork or education ahead of major review
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,7,FMcFadden told the BBC ministers would
OL,8,F"take those [recommendations] forward".
